{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12104010","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12104010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1210401001:0":{"text":"와... 진짜 높네요. 이렇게 높은 벽은 처음 봐요.","source_cn":"哇……好高，满满第一次看到这么高的墙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x715A63A78A5A36C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1210401002:0":{"text":"이건 블러디 로즈 조선소의 벽이야. 물귀신파의 습격을 막으려고 일부러 벽을 이렇게 높게 지은 거지.","source_cn":"这是血薇帮造船厂的墙。为了防止水鬼帮偷袭，他们故意把墙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x263A10FF02259442","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1210401003:0":{"text":"계단 쪽으로 가지 마. 거긴 블러디 로즈의 구역이니까.","source_cn":"别往楼梯上走，那是血薇帮的地盘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BCB802618B0B915","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"신밧드","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}